              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Naval War is a commercial card-based naval combat game where players operate ships and attack opposing fleets."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "First published by Battleline Publications in 1979, Naval War is a light card-driven naval combat game rather than a simulation of actual naval tactics."
            }
